Because they drop frequently from many different monsters, they’re often available on the market for about half their NPC price.

Can be used on the small boat south-west in the [[Isle of Ada]], {{Mapper Coords|132.39|125.232|7|4|text=here}}, for a chance to get teleported to the small boat north of the isle, {{Mapper Coords|132.109|125.106|7|4|text=here}}.

It is not guaranteed to succeed, and might require a few tries. The item does not disappear when used.
* when failing: {{Server Message|You were not able to fix the boat with the repair kit and the few spare parts it came with.}}
* when suceeding: {{Server Message|You manage to repair the boat using the kit. The small boat is sturdy enough to sail around the reef and towards a tiny bay at the back of the isle.}}

Part of [[The Roost of the Graveborn Quest]]. After finishing the quest, using the {{ilink|Jade Dragon Head}} [[Jade Dragon Head]] will transform it into this charged version. It can be used with a [[cooldown]] of 14 days, granting one [[Ancestral Charge]] and one [[Favour of the Ancients]], and becoming an {{ilink|Inert Dragon Head}} [[Inert Dragon Head]]. The following messages will show up:
* On success: {{Server Message|You have gained Ancestral Charges and Favour of the Ancients!}}
* On failure: {{Server Message|It is too early to use this again!}}
